WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:04,540
Thank you for sending me here

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:08,660
Have a good rest and talk less

3
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,890
I actually have nothing serious to do

4
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:11,970
Just a cold

5
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:13,250
Tell the doctor

6
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,050
We are leaving the hospital and returning to the company now

7
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:16,450
There is something important in the company today

8
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:19,210
It's just a cold. Do you know that you've already fainted from a fever?

9
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:20,610
Do you know what the doctor said?

10
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,010
The doctor said you have a severe cold

11
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:24,970
You have a high fever and it lasted for a long time. He said you have been cold for at least several days.

12
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:28,010
If you send it here a little later today, your life will be dead Zhang Yuhan

13
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:31,010
Is this the time when the company is more important or life is more important?

14
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,130
Still thinking about going back to the company

15
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:33,570
You can die if you want

16
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:37,090
I'll call your dad over and tell him not to die in my hands.

17
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:38,370
I can't bear this responsibility

18
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:40,370
Even my dad has never been so cruel to me

19
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:43,840
He is worried about me

20
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:49,950
You go to the scrap payment window to pay the scrap now.

21
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,550
After the scrap is paid, we can check him out.

22
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,800
Nurse, look at him and wait for me to come back before you leave.

23
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,760
Okay, I will keep your wife safe
